(text "How to read it" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 100.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fa91891e-480e-58ce-bb63-3e6e4883665b"))
(text "Every pin has a stub and a net label: the label names the net, so\neach pin says where it goes. Labels with a flag shape are global\n(used on more than one sheet); plain text labels stay on one sheet.\nEach box above is a sheet: double-click it in KiCad to open it\n(or page down in the PDF). Location field: box, A1 (the interface board),\ncar, dash. Source field: owned, ordered 24 Oct, stock car, to buy, TBD.\nTables: NETS.md, CONNECTORS.md, WIRE_LIST.md, BOM.md (same data)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 103.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bd9c7fb1-af8a-5949-abd6-fb504a5adbc4"))
(text "Three safety layers (POWER_CHAIN.md)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 125.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0ec4822b-5da2-55bf-9a7e-3ca170e40fa6"))
(text "1. A power chain a person can always cut, no software:\n   F1, key SW1 and E-stop S2 (two NC blocks) in the K1 coil.\n2. Drivers that default off: DRIVE_EN / STEER_EN pulled down\n   at every board; K1 coil MOSFET Q1 pulled down.\n3. The ESP32 only adds control on top, and can only open K1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 128.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3b00c66a-5a37-5c7d-90dd-d2a299910550"))
(text "Open items (TBD)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 145.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "da04ee25-83ac-55d7-937b-59a70cba4321"))
(text "#17 stock plug types and pin use: J1-J8 (car-facing plugs)\n#33 motor pairing in the harness: J6/J7 splitter or not\n#13 battery voltage and chemistry: D2 TVS value, BTS7960 27.5 V limit\n#14 motor labels: per-motor current, variant A or B (#32)\n#18 box size: variant A (5 boards) or B (2 boards)\n#16 pedal type: switch, pot or 5 V hall (divider)\n#15 IBT-2 IS resistor: config IS_RESISTOR_OHMS\nKey switch rating (SW1 carries ~8 A worst case)\nShifter: signal-only or motor current (only signal can go to U24)\nK1 precharge resistor: after the bench test\nAS5600 cable length: I2C or analog OUT on U23 A1\nVariant B current sensors (#32)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 148.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "081e6f00-c121-5965-a4ba-1a1ee57cff8e"))
(text "Revisions" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 180.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ebe5af47-eff5-5ff6-b7dc-9776def834e3"))
(text "0.3 2026-10-24  First KiCad version, from draft v0.2 (SVG).\n                Net names, connector/pin tables, wire list, BOM\n                matched to the 24 Oct order. Changes are listed\n                in README.md, 'Changes from draft v0.2'." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 183.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c1b4fc7a-1426-5782-8a7c-572c5554d3b3"))
